SKILL GAP ANALYZER: TECHNICAL MASTER FILE
=========================================

1. SYSTEM OVERVIEW
------------------
The system is a production-grade AI recruiter tool using FastAPI, MySQL, and Scikit-Learn.

2. MODULES
----------
A. DB MODULE: MySQL storage for Categories, Skills, and Results.
B. NLP MODULE: Professional parser for PDF/DOCX/HTML/TXT with Level 2 cleaning.
C. EXTRACTOR: Case-insensitive, strict-boundary skill identification.
D. ML ENGINE: TF-IDF + Cosine Similarity for domain context analysis.
E. SCORING: 50% technical + 50% semantic + Experience/Project boosts.
F. RECOMMENDATIONS: Detailed project-based career roadmaps.

3. SETUP COMMANDS
-----------------
1. pip install -r requirements.txt
2. python -m app.seed
3. uvicorn app.main:app

4. FILE STRUCTURE
-----------------
- backend/app/database.py      (DB Config)
- backend/app/models.py        (SQLAlchemy Models)
- backend/app/parser.py        (NLP Parser)
- backend/app/skill_extractor (Skill logic)
- backend/app/semantic_engine  (ML Logic)
- backend/app/scoring_system   (Decision Logic)
- backend/app/recommendations  (Career Logic)

---
Master Guide Complete.
